# Architecture

This is a static Vite + React game deployed to GitHub Pages.

- Change gameplay only in `src/game/` (`constants.ts`, `wheel.ts`, `reducer.ts`).
- React components dispatch existing `GameAction`s and render `GameState`. Do not embed round/water/reward logic in JSX.
- Add shadcn pieces with `npx shadcn@latest add`. Leave `src/components/ui/` as generated.
- Keep the production build a static `dist/` (no server). GitHub Pages uses `GITHUB_PAGES=true` so Vite `base` is `/BladderInferno/`.
